#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House2/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House2_Text_BuyHarborMailAtSlateport"
msgid ""
"If I had a BIKE, it'd be easy to cycle to\n"
"SLATEPORT for some shopping.\p"
"I'd be able to buy HARBOR MAIL at the\n"
"POKéMON MART in SLATEPORT…$"
msgstr ""
"要是我有自行车，\n"
"就能轻松骑到凯那市去买东西了。\p"
"还能在凯那市的友好商店\n"
"买港口邮件……$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House2/scripts.inc:50
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House2_Text_TradeHarborMailForCoinCase"
msgid ""
"Oh! You have HARBOR MAIL?\n"
"Will you trade it for a COIN CASE?$"
msgstr ""
"啊！你有港口邮件？\n"
"能和我的代币盒交换吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House2/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House2_Text_IllTradeYouCoinCase"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm so happy!\n"
"Okay, I'll trade you a COIN CASE!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，我好开心！\n"
"好，我用代币盒跟你换！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House2/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House2_Text_UseCoinCaseAtGameCorner"
msgid ""
"That COIN CASE can be used\n"
"at the GAME CORNER.$"
msgstr ""
"那个代币盒\n"
"可以在游戏城里使用。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House2/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_House2_Text_ThatsDisappointing"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's disappointing.\p"
"A COIN CASE is needed for the\n"
"GAME CORNER.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，真让人失望。\p"
"在游戏城里\n"
"需要代币盒哦。$"
